 "intro_html": "Korean cold noodles made from buckwheat, sweet potato starch and wheat. They’re scrubbed under cold water and iced until really chewy, then dressed in a sweet-hot sauce ground with pear. A soba alternative to the rice-noodle stir-fries — cold and spicy instead of the <a href=\"chicken-pad-see-ew.html\">pad see ew</a>.",
