   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the broth base with the water and freeze for 2–3 hours, until slushy.</li><li>Short on time: broth base + <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"240\" data-s=\"0\">240 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\" data-alt=\"1\">1 cup</span>)</span> cold water + 10–12 ice cubes, in the freezer while you prepare everything else.</li></ul>",
