   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the reserved half pear in the food processor with:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>garlic <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-f=\"clove|cloves\" data-n=\"1\">2 cloves</span></span></li><li>ginger <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li><li>onion <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tbsp</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"20\" data-alt=\"1\">20 g</span>)</span></span></li><li>green onions, chopped <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-n=\"1\">2</span></span></li><li>korean hot pepper flakes (gochugaru) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"25\" data-b=\"30\">25–30 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.25\" data-alt=\"1\">¼ cup</span>)</span></span></li><li>hot pepper paste (gochujang) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tbsp</span></span></li><li>soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>kosher salt <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>sugar (sauce) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\" data-b=\"3\">2–3 tsp</span> (see notes)</span></li><li>rice syrup <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"60\">60 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.25\" data-alt=\"1\">¼ cup</span>)</span></span></li><li>white vinegar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tbsp</span></span></li><li>toasted sesame oil <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\"